# Keep the build context small and free of local-machine artefacts.
#
# data/ is 510 MB of MIT1003 evaluation fixtures that the running app never
# touches - it is for the offline benchmark only, and is fetched on demand by
# scripts/fetch_eval_data.sh.

.git
.github
.venv
.run
data
results
analysis
docs
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
*.log

# Local-only notes and coursework. Kept out so the public image stays tidy.
*.md
!README.md

# Editor noise
.vscode
.idea